 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "For forty days the giant shouted",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Morning and evening, loud and tall",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "All the soldiers shook and trembled",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.39,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No one dared to fight at all",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.4,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Then a shepherd boy came running",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bringing bread for brothers three",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.28,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Said why is everybody hiding",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.22,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "God is bigger, come and see",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Five smooth stones from the stream",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.13,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A sling and a shepherd's bag",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not a sword and not a spear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But a heart that trusts in the LORD",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.46,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "One, two, three, four, five",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.36,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Little David, brave and wise",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "King Saul gave him his heavy armor",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Bronze helmet shining on his head",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.37,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "David tried to walk and wobbled",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I'm not used to these, he said",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So he took his staff and pebbles",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Ran to meet the giant there",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
